{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You will be the judge of the dead\u2026 and every choice will be remembered.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">I am Morta, your guide in this place. I will show you the tombs, the broken lives, and the voices that still echo in the dark. But the verdict is yours alone.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015120/extras/f62ac41ea1031e3e9e39da2ac37e0e0b.avif?t=1762020471\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luce Spenta</strong> is a gothic and psychological visual novel where power rests in your hands: you will decide the fate of five souls \u2014 forgiveness, reproach, oblivion, or execution.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf11 A gothic, dark atmosphere with detailed art and haunting soundscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2696\ufe0f A moral journey that changes according to your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd00 More than 25 different endings reflecting the weight of your judgments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Unexpected and disturbing moments that will test your will.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 A mostly narrative experience, perfect to accompany you for several days... or more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each grave hides a sin, and every story stirs a different feeling: compassion, anger, rejection, melancholy.<br>As you move forward, <strong>Morta</strong> will guide you through this path of broken voices and shattered memories\u2026 and what you uncover will also reveal who you truly are.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">By looking and analyzing this page, you\u2019re already a judge.<br><i>Luce Spenta</i> doesn\u2019t begin when you play it, but when you decide to observe it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Your eyes read\u2026 and Morta\u2019s are already upon you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>Your choices carry weight.</i></strong><br><strong><i>The tombs await your decision.</i></strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Miner","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015120/02eb57170f1f8a4b18d7a14721ab591784f2c04a.jpg"},{"name":"The Mother","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015120/ec0e8c12f7192fb7d53796fa3d3657089d321833.jpg"},{"name":"The Politician","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015120/e3a7102f852d6fffafc4e7c958e24d294681f054.jpg"},{"name":"The Model","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015120/7fcae9b6c0d36dd0a4261f7955ce7cbd7739e872.jpg"},{"name":"The Sick Child","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015120/4701f0ffc03686b7628b9b51d002b26a9217e9ee.jpg"},{"name":"The Beginning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015120/190452a62d690388ab99cc1a95d79e76f49eb27d.jpg"},{"name":"The Guardian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015120/fb049a7438350502308040978067b31641fe637e.jpg"},{"name":"The Chamber","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015120/cbf9f09b3639294b1e051653909cbc278013f061.jpg"},{"name":"The Wrong Path","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4015120/