s intended to unsettle the player. No explicit sexual activity or graphic violence is depicted."},"demos":[{"appid":4061590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>You will be the judge of the dead\u2026 and every choice will be remembered.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">I am Morta, your guide in this place. I will show you the tombs, the broken lives, and the voices that still echo in the dark. But the verdict is yours alone.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015120/extras/f62ac41ea1031e3e9e39da2ac37e0e0b.avif?t=1762020471\" width=256 height=256 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luce Spenta</strong> is a gothic and psychological visual novel where power rests in your hands: you will decide the fate of five souls \u2014 forgiveness, reproach, oblivion, or execution.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf11 A gothic, dark atmosphere with detailed art and haunting soundscapes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2696\ufe0f A moral journey that changes according to your choices.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd00 More than 25 different endings reflecting the weight of your judgments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc80 Unexpected and disturbing moments that will test your will.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcd6 A mostly narrative experience, perfect to accompany you for several days... or more.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each grave hides a sin, and every story stirs a different feeling: compassion, anger, reje